# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible: anything that is
# generated, machine-specific, or irrelevant to running the demo.
.git/
.gitattributes
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.astro/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
frontend/e2e/
tests/
docs/
*.ps1
*.sh
*.md
!backend/README.md
